.git
.github
.githooks
.claude
.gitignore
.nojekyll
.oxlintrc.json
.wrangler
.dev.vars*
node_modules
package.json
package-lock.json
playwright.config.mjs
test-results
playwright-report
tests
scripts
wrangler.jsonc
worker

# Notes and the old address's "moved" page (served by GitHub Pages instead)
docs
moved
README.md
